==Battleground==
*2 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] (10%) spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Corporal Weyland]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*2 [[H. Nah]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s (400%) spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*15 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*10 [[Gabriel]]s (400%) spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Corporal Weyland]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] is very effective in this stage, especially with his Resist Knockback [[Talents|Talent]] (though Talents are hardly necessary, even on higher difficulties). On the other hand, some units such as [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] can take advantage of the knockback and warp effects to hit multiple times.

