==Trivia==
*Eat the Weak's Japanese name, Jakuniku Chōshoku (弱肉朝食, "Weak Meat Breakfast"), is a pun on ''jakuniku kyōshoku'' (弱肉強食, "weak meat, strong food"), the Japanese version of the expression "law of the jungle".

